  "body": "mcp: match allowed server URLs to the fetch destination\n\nCompare HTTP(S) MCP allowlist patterns against the WHATWG URL destination\ninstead of the raw configured string.\n\n- Canonicalize HTTP(S) candidate URLs with the URL parser and match\n  origin, path, and query\n- Treat reverse solidus as an authority terminator in URL patterns\n- Restrict authority wildcards so they do not consume userinfo or path\n  separators\n- Add unit tests for alternate URL spellings and unparseable input\n\n(Commit message generated by Copilot)",
